<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 02:20:35 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Elon Musk 全力以赴，在其大型数据中心引入了 120 万个 NVIDIA 最新 GPU，以对抗 OpenAI</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/elon-musk-goes-all-in-to-bring-a-whopping-1-2-million-nvidias-latest-gpus-online-in-his-mega-data-center-to-take-on-openai</link><description>马斯克声称 xAI 可以在六个月内达到“杆位”，尽管在人工智能竞赛中落后 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 数年。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/elon-musk-goes-all-in-to-bring-a-whopping-1-2-million-nvidias-latest-gpus-online-in-his-mega-data-center-to-take-on-openai.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 02:20:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/elon-musk-goes-all-in-to-bring-a-whopping-1-2-million-nvidias-latest-gpus-online-in-his-mega-data-center-to-take-on-openai</guid></item><item><title>科学家们在破纪录的量子实验中同时将一小块金属放在两个地方</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-put-a-tiny-lump-of-metal-in-two-places-at-once-in-record-breaking-quantum-experiment</link><description>科学家们完成了一项听起来几乎不可能的令人费解的量子实验：他们表明，由数千个原子组成的微小金属颗粒可以同时存在于多个位置。维也纳大学的研究人员利用先进的激光技术观察到钠纳米粒子中的量子干涉，其大小远远大于通常看到的具有这种行为的粒子种类。这一发现将量子力学推向了一个新领域，表明即使是令人惊讶的“大”物体仍然遵守量子世界的奇异规则。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-put-a-tiny-lump-of-metal-in-two-places-at-once-in-record-breaking-quantum-experiment.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 02:05:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-put-a-tiny-lump-of-metal-in-two-places-at-once-in-record-breaking-quantum-experiment</guid></item><item><title>腹部CT诊断专家级全能AI</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/an-expert-level-generalist-ai-for-abdominal-ct-diagnosis</link><description>放射学领域的人工智能 (AI) 渴望在不同的临床任务中提供专家级的诊断，但现有的监督策略的范围仍然有限。我们开发了 RADAR，这是一种通用视觉语言模型，经过超过 400,000 次对比增强腹部计算机断层扫描 (CT) 检查和 1500 万个解剖学图像文本对的训练，直接从临床报告中学习，无需手动注释。在跨多个中心和不同临床场景的内部和外部评估中，RADAR 对 18 个解剖结构和 146 个成像结果实现了高诊断性能和稳健的概括。在一项读者研究中，RADAR 辅助将 26 名放射科医生的诊断灵敏度提高了约 10%。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/an-expert-level-generalist-ai-for-abdominal-ct-diagnosis2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 01:50:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/an-expert-level-generalist-ai-for-abdominal-ct-diagnosis</guid></item><item><title>萤火虫公司在德克萨斯州的新设施内部，旨在为美国宇航局月球基地提供动力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/inside-fireflys-new-texas-facility-built-to-help-power-nasas-moon-base</link><description>德克萨斯州雪松公园 (KXAN)——月球着陆器正在德克萨斯州中部安家。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/inside-fireflys-new-texas-facility-built-to-help-power-nasas-moon-base.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 01:35:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/inside-fireflys-new-texas-facility-built-to-help-power-nasas-moon-base</guid></item><item><title>数字细胞预测哪种药物对致命乳腺癌最有效</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-digital-cell-predicts-which-drugs-will-be-most-effective-in-deadly-breast-cancer</link><description>数以百万计的蛋白质测量数据为人工智能模型提供了动力，该模型可以预测侵袭性乳腺癌的药物反应和结果。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-digital-cell-predicts-which-drugs-will-be-most-effective-in-deadly-breast-cancer2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 01:20:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/a-digital-cell-predicts-which-drugs-will-be-most-effective-in-deadly-breast-cancer</guid></item><item><title>Unitree 声称新型人形机器人超越尤塞恩·博尔特</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/unitree-claims-new-humanoid-robot-outruns-usain-bolt</link><description>这家华丽的公司最近完成了一次轰动的首次公开募股，似乎在人形机器人制造商中处于领先地位。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/unitree-claims-new-humanoid-robot-outruns-usain-bolt.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 01:05:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/unitree-claims-new-humanoid-robot-outruns-usain-bolt</guid></item><item><title>特斯拉使用内部电池材料制造了第一辆网络驾驶室</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tesla-builds-first-cybercab-using-in-house-battery-materials</link><description>特斯拉致力于将其电池供应链集中在一个屋檐下，这在工厂车间取得了一个重要的里程碑。第一款由完全内部生产的阴极电池材料提供动力的 Cyber​​cab 已在德克萨斯州超级工厂正式下线。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/tesla-builds-first-cybercab-using-in-house-battery-materials.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:50:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tesla-builds-first-cybercab-using-in-house-battery-materials</guid></item><item><title>实验性癌症疫苗可以自行产生氧气并增强 T 细胞的活力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/experimental-cancer-vaccine-makes-its-own-oxygen-and-gives-t-cells-a-boost</link><description>当谈到生活中的优先事项时，氧气位居榜首。人类可以连续几周不吃东西，几天不喝水。然而，如果失去了呼吸的能力，随着大脑开始关闭，时间会在几分钟内开始滴答作响。但赋予生命的气体的作用比你想象的还要大。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/experimental-cancer-vaccine-makes-its-own-oxygen-and-gives-t-cells-a-boost.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:35:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/experimental-cancer-vaccine-makes-its-own-oxygen-and-gives-t-cells-a-boost</guid></item><item><title>三岁男孩的转移性癌症在两次实验性细胞疗法后消失</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/three-year-old-boys-metastatic-cancer-disappears-after-two-shots-of-experimental-cell-therapy</link><description>这个男孩的肝癌已经扩散到肺部，没有出现任何危险的副作用，一年后仍然没有癌症。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/three-year-old-boys-metastatic-cancer-disappears-after-two-shots-of-experimental-cell-therapy2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 16:03:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/three-year-old-boys-metastatic-cancer-disappears-after-two-shots-of-experimental-cell-therapy</guid></item><item><title>大脑如何决定在何处对其自身线路进行绝缘</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-the-brain-decides-where-to-insulate-its-own-wiring</link><description>生物学家揭示神经元在引导髓磷脂到达特定位置方面“有发言权” &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-the-brain-decides-where-to-insulate-its-own-wiring.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 15:48:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-the-brain-decides-where-to-insulate-its-own-wiring</guid></item></channel></rss>